.el .ds Aq '
.TH stool-dotfile-gpg-backup 1  "stool-dotfile-gpg-backup "
.SH NAME
stool\-dotfile\-gpg\-backup \- Export selected GPG keys and ownertrust into an encrypted backup
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstool\-dotfile\-gpg\-backup\fR <\fB\-\-fingerprint\fR> [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-identity\fR] [\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR] [\fB\-\-gpg\-program\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export selected GPG keys and ownertrust into an encrypted backup
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-fingerprint\fR \fI<FINGERPRINT>\fR
Complete primary GPG fingerprint; repeat to select multiple keys
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Backup directory (defaults to .stooltemplates/gpg in the source)
.TP
\fB\-\-identity\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Separate age identity kept outside the repository
.TP
\fB\-\-passphrase\-file\fR \fI<PASSPHRASE_FILE>\fR
Read the password from private external storage or an inherited pipe
.TP
\fB\-\-gpg\-program\fR \fI<GPG_PROGRAM>\fR
GPG executable (GPG Suite is detected on macOS)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
